rfaces, gain / loss, risk levels, success / disabled, accents and chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the page indicator, the sheets and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the coin logos, neutral avatar and icons from 04 · Media. Emoji in the copy are plain text characters. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"207\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:47\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"595\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1294\">\n      <text id=\"3:48\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:49\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:50\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1203\">\n        <frame id=\"3:51\" name=\"01_Wallet\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"371\">\n          <text id=\"3:52\" name=\"01_Wallet\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"86\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:53\" name=\"Goal: See total balance, assets and savings pockets.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:54\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:55\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_Neutral · “My Wallet” · address 0xc8...320f · scan entry • Actions: Send · Receive • Assets: “Assets” · Ethereum / Dai / Avalanche / PancakeSwap, each with logo, name, holding, value and 24h change • Balance: $54,292.79 · +5.21% • Main naviga