or 3:36, Button 3:19, TextField 3:22.\n\nNote: get_node_by_id async? In plugin API: `await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"2:8\")` (modern). figma.getNodeById is sync but deprecated; may still work. Use getNodeByIdAsync.\n\nAlso: setting page: `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)` — must use for switching. Current page might already be any; I'll set to workspace page each script.\n\nEmoji in text: to render emoji, no special font needed.\n\nU+2212 minus: \"−\". Copy strings carefully:\n- \"−0.02%\", \"−2.13%\", \"−0.12%\", \"−0.17%\" etc.\n\nLet me define exact strings:\n\nAssets rows:\n1. Ethereum | 2.569032 ETH | $3,226.31 | +3.48% (gain) — logo ETH\n2. Dai | 3,045.86 DAI | $3,021.15 | −0.02% (loss) — DAI\n3. Avalanche | 180.02 AVAX | $2,440.09 | +1.54% — AVAX\n4. PancakeSwap | 397.33 CAKE | $1,573.63 | −0.02% — CAKE\n\nPockets:\n1. 🏡 My New House | $15,642.40 | +7.86%\n2. 🚙 Tesla Model S Plaid | $28,389.21 | −2.13%\n3. Add Pocket (dashed card with Icon_Add)\n\nFor You:\n1. Stable Income | Low risk · 10,982 participants | 6.24% per year | View\n2. Binance Index Strategy | Medium risk · 264 participants | 12.56% per year | View\n\nStrategies (return, name, logos, more):\n1. 15.16% | The Big Long | BTC ETH USDT | +3\n2. 159% | Aggressive Growth | MATIC MANA CAKE | +2\n3. 46.22% | Best Projects | NEAR DASH AVAX | +12\n4. 26.08% | Strategy 2022 | ETC DAI BNB | +2\n\nCoins:\n1. Bitcoin BTC $16,963.58 −0.12%\n2. Ethereum ETH $1,259.10 +1.15%\n3. Tether USDT $1.01 +0.01%\n4. Binance Coin BNB $288.01 +0.76%\n5. USD Coin USDC $0.9999 −0.02%\n6. Binance USD BUSD $1.00 −0.01%\n7. XRP XRP $0.3891 +2.54%\n8. Dogecoin DOGE $0.1012 −0.17%\n9. Cardano ADA $0.3196 +0.09%\n10. Polygon MATIC $0.9082 +2.18%\n\n03 Strategy sheet content:\n- Title \"Aggressive Growth\" + chip \"🔥 High Risk\"\n- Facts (5): 🌱 159% per Year / Interest Income; 🔥 High Risk / Level of risk; 💵 $1,000 / Minimum investment amount; 🗓️ 2 Years / Recommended investment period; 🧑 1,982 / Participants\n- Projection card: