ow 0; simpler: spacer grows, change width 52 textAlign right. Set change textAutoResize NONE w 52 h 14? Fiddly. Alternative: change text right aligned: set textAlignHorizontal='RIGHT', textAutoResize='NONE', resize(52,14). OK.\n   Name+ticker: to keep single line: name fixed? \"Binance Coin\" + \"BNB\" — widths vary; fine, spacer grows.\n\n15. `Row/Share` — 343×24 horizontal gap 8 center: logo inst 18 (\"logo\"), name 12 Medium (\"name\"), spacer, pct 12 SemiBold (\"pct\").\n\n16. `Header/Sheet` — 343×28 horizontal center gap 8: back icon inst 22 (\"back\"), spacer(6), title 16 Bold (\"title\") centered — layout: [back][grow spacer][title][grow spacer][close]. title centered via two grow spacers. child names \"back\",\"title\",\"close\". Instance overrides: hide back (visible=false) when not needed.\n\nSheet container: not a component (each sheet unique) — but brief says \"the sheets ... as reusable components\"? Item 4: \"Design all other states, the headers, the page indicator, the sheets and every business component as reusable components\". Hmm — \"the sheets\" should be components! OK: make `Sheet/Base` component: 375×h? Sheet sizes differ. Component: 375 wide, hug height, auto-layout vertical pad 16/20 gap 10, bg white, top radius 24, grabber included. Then each sheet = instance + appended content? Can't append into instance! Problem. \n\nSolution: sheets as components where content children exist in master... can't vary count per instance. Alternative: make each full sheet its own component (Sheet/Strategy, Sheet/Amount, Sheet/Success) — they ARE reusable components then, instanced into frames. That satisfies \"sheets as reusable components\". Similarly maybe big screens? Not needed — frames are screens.\n\nSo: build Sheet/Strategy, Sheet/InvestAmount, Sheet/Success as COMPONENT nodes (placed at component area x=-1600), then place INSTANCES in 03/04/05 frames. Interactions attach to nodes inside instances (allowed? Interactions can be set on instance children