d ids.receiveBtn ✓ (7:37).\n\nFix script (S3b):\n- remove 7:24, 7:28.\n- Rebuild 01_Wallet content: the frame 7:52 exists with status inside; append remaining children. Use direct ids: header = \"6:216\", receive = \"7:37\", send = \"5:8\", pockets \"6:43\",\"6:52\",\"6:61\", section title comp \"5:18\", chip \"5:2\", pager \"5:21\", home \"3:36\".\n\nCareful with instance child overrides: t1.findOne(...).characters — allowed.\n\nAssets card: after appendChild of rows, card is auto-layout VERTICAL with FIXED both — children rows 343 wide... card padding L/R 0 → inner width 343 ✓ height 232 fixed with 4×58=232 + pad 8 = 240 > 232 overflow. Set card height 240, or reduce: rows 58 → card 4*58+8=240. Adjust: card.y=262, height 240 → ends 502. Pockets title at 514 → ok (gap 12). Fine — set card.resize(343,240). Hmm primaryAxisSizingMode FIXED; children 232+pad8=240 exactly if I set 240. Rows at 58 each: 4×58=232, +8 padding = 240 ✓.\n\nWait, actually let me set card primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO' (hug) and width FIXED 343: then height auto = 240. Safer.\n\nBalance row: br primary FIXED width 343, counter AUTO: resizeWithoutConstraints(343,44) — for horizontal AL, counter axis = vertical; setting counter AUTO then height hugs (32px text → ~44). OK.\n\nPager instance resizeWithoutConstraints(375,70) — instance of component 375×62 with FIXED both axes → resize works ✓.\n\nLet me write S3b to complete 01_Wallet, then in the same script also start 02_Discovery (S4). Actually keep scripts focused: S3b completes wallet; verify; then S4.\n\nActually to save round trips, do S3b + S4 in one script — Discovery is big but manageable. If it fails partway, metadata will show where.\n\n02_Discovery build (375×812, x=475):\n- bg #F2F3F7, name \"02_Discovery\"\n- status inst (0,0)\n- header/search inst 7:29 at (16,54) — override nothing\n- Section title \"For You Today\" inst 5:18 at (16,104): title override 'For You Today', action 'December 05'\n- ForYou cards: 6:65 at (16,128), 6:75 at (192,128) — 167 wide, gap 9 → 16+167=183+9=192+167=359 ✓\n- Section title \"Investing Strategies\" (16,208)\n- Strategy grid: 6:85 (16,232), 6:94 (192,232), 6:103 (16,310), 6:112 (192,310) — 72 tall, gap 6 → 232+72=304+6=310, +72=382\n- Section title \"Coin Lists\" (16,398)\n- Tabs: two rows of Chip/Tab instances: row1: \"🔥 Trending\" (active), \"📺 Watchlist\", \"❤️ Favorites\"; row2: \"💵 Stablecoins\", \"🔗 BNB Chain Ecosystem\". Chip/Tab master 87×26 bg #EEF0F5 text #70767F. Active: override text color white + bg brand. Instance override fills on the instance root: allowed (chI.fills=[solid(brand)]). Text child fills white.\n  Row1 at y=424, chips hug widths; place manually: chip widths vary. Use auto-layout row frames: row frame at (16,424) horizontal gap 8 hug; chips inside. row2 at (16,458).\n- Coins: 10 rows at y=490, 27px apart: y=490+i*27 → last starts 733, ends 759. Pager at 742? Overlap. Recount: 10×26 rows (26 tall) with 1px gap = 269 → 490..759. Pager needs y=742. Conflict.\n\nSqueeze: coins rows 26 tall, spacing 0: 490..750. Pager at 742 overlaps. Move: tabs at 424..450 (row1 26), row2 456..482. Coins start 488: 488+260=748. Pager at y=742 (h70) → overlap 6px with last coin row bottom (748). Hmm.\n\nOption: last coin row is partially covered by pager — in real app the list scrolls under the pager. Since 01/02/03 may scroll vertically, content extending under the pager is actually natural (scrollable content). But visually overlapping rows look broken in a static frame.\n\nBetter: tighten above: \n- header 54..98 (44)\n- ForYou title 104..124\n- FY cards 128..200 (72)\n- Strategies title 206..226\n- grid 230..382 (two rows 72+6)\n- Coin Lists title 392..412\n- tabs 416..442, 446..472\n- coins 476..736 (10×26)\n- pager 742..812 ✓ no overlap (736 < 742)\n\nGaps: 4-6px, acceptable.\n\nTitle positions: 104, 206, 392. Cards 128. Grid 230. Tabs 416/446. Coins 476.\n\nPager override: label 'Discovery', dot3 brand, dot1/2 gray.\n\nWait — dot2 default is brand in master (I set dot2 brand default). So for 02: dot3 brand, dot2 gray. For 01: done in S3b.\n\nHome indicator (0,778).\n\nAlso — \"02_Discovery\" must allow scrolling: content fits within 812 anyway.\n\nCoin row instances: \"6:121\",\"6:128\",\"6:135\",\"6:142\",\"6:149\",\"6:156\",\"6:163\",\"6:170\",\"6:177\",\"6:184\".\n\nTab chips: Chip/Tab master \"5:4\". Row1 chips: '🔥 Trending' (active), '📺 Watchlist', '❤️ Favorites'; row2: '💵 Stablecoins', '🔗 BNB Chain Ecosystem'. Rows are auto-layout hug frames at x=16.\n\nWrite S3b+S4 now. Also cleanup 7:24/7:28.","signature":"5c943f8fa4144a2e8cb8c48a"}],"id":"ebc75ae3-1883-4294-8808-cbe557064df4","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b54d81e-1062-44f7-87fa-749cc21f1674","uuid":"9861e86a-e200-489d-9f8b-aa03d770bb6d","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:54:58.757Z","thinking_duration_ms":39609}
