{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Progress: header, balanceRow, send placed. Then it failed at `await inst(F,\"7:37\",192,168,'receive')` — no wait, next line after send is:\n```js\nconst sendL=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"7:60\")).findOne?null:null;\n```\nThat line was garbage I left in — `figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"7:60\")` returns a promise; if node 7:60 doesn't exist, it returns null, then `.findOne` on null → TypeError. That line threw! My mistake — remove it.\n\nAlso balanceRow is 100 wide?? resizeWithoutConstraints wasn't called on br — I set primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED' but never set width! I forgot br.resizeWithoutConstraints(343,44). It shows 100×44 with chip at x=192 — wait, that's beyond 100 width... The metadata shows balanceRow width=100 but chip at x=192? Weird — layoutGrow spacer expanded... whatever, it's wrong; fix: br.resize(343,44).\n\nFix script (S3c):\n- br (8:56) resize to 343×44.\n- continue: receive at (192,168), assetsTitle, card, pocketsTitle, pockets, pager, home — from where it stopped. But careful not to duplicate send. Resume after send.\n\nThen 02_Discovery wasn't created (whole try aborted). Redo D part.\n\nCombine into one script again, minus the bad line.","signature":"59ad96beb8094e13bf64cbc5"}],"id":"4be0ea95-c9d4-4f26-a8a6-ef492c033840","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b54d81e-1062-44f7-87fa-749cc21f1674","uuid":"adfc723d-7a01-49df-9dfd-125eabf3059c","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:55:46.401Z","thinking_duration_ms":7199}
