n INSTANCE? Instances inherit master sizing; after master fix, instances hug.\n\nAdditionally: facts row 1 has 3 chips; with 2-line labels all ~54 → fine.\n\nAlso \"💰 $1,000\" — brief says 💵. I used 💵 ✓. Screenshot shows 💵? Shows money bag? It shows \"💵\"? I see a banknote-ish glyph ✓.\n\nOther fixes in same script:\n- grabber centering wrapper.\n- Maybe reduce projection caption to avoid 2-line overflow — it's fine (2 lines shown).\n\nAlso note: sheet height will change after chip fix → need to reposition instance y = 812-newH. Handle in script: read C.height after changes, set si.y.\n\nThen S6: Sheet/Amount + 04. Let me do fixes + S6 in one script, then S7 + screenshots.\n\nS6 Sheet/Amount build:\n```\nC2 comp 'Sheet/Amount' x=-560 y=850\nvertical AL, width 375, hug height, pad L/R 16, T 10, B 24, gap 12, white, top radius 24, shadow.\n- grabber (wrapper centered)\n- header 7:41 inst: title 'Invest to Strategy'\n- currency row: horizontal gap 10 center: DAI logo inst 40 (2:38) 'logo'; 'DAI' 15 Bold; spacer; swap chip: frame 32×32 r16 #F5F6FA center: Icon_Swap inst 16 ink2.\n- amount '3,021' 42 ExtraBold brand\n- sub row: '⛽️ No gas, free investments' 11 Medium ink3\n- row: Max chip (inst 5:4 override 'Max') + spacer + 'Balance 3,045.86 DAI · Minimum $1,000 met' 10 Medium ink3 right-aligned width? two texts: balance + spacer + min? Brief: \"Balance 3,045.86 DAI · Minimum $1,000 met\". Single text right side ok. Max chip on left.\n- keypad: vertical gap 8, 4 rows horizontal gap 5: keys resized 82×50.\n  Key/Keypad master 5:15 (105×54): override digit + letters. resize(82,50).\n  Row1: ('1',''), ('2','ABC'), ('3','DEF')\n  Row2: ('4','GHI'), ('5','JKL'), ('6','MNO')\n  Row3: ('7','PQRS'), ('8','TUV'), ('9','WXYZ')\n  Row4: (',',''), ('0',''), backspace custom frame 82×50 r12 #F5F6FA center Icon_Backspace inst (23×17 natural → resize to 20×15? keep 23×17) ink2 recolor.\n  Keypad container width 343: rows hug: 3×82+2×5=256 < 343 — keys should be evenly spread: rows primaryAxisAlignItems='SPACE_BETWEEN' width 343? Keys 82 wide spread across 343 → gaps 48.5 — too spread. Better keys 105×54 with gap 8: 3×105+16=331 ≤ 343 ✓ rows hug centered. Row height 54, 4 rows + gaps 8 → 240. Sheet total: 24+28+12+40+12+52+16+16+12+240+14+52+24 ≈ 542. Sheet y=812-542=270. Fine — keeps discovery visible. Key master is 105×54 already — no resize needed ✓.\n- Btn/Hold inst 7:47 343×52.\nPosition instance in 04 frame.\n```\n\nFonts for overrides: Nunito loaded.\n\nFor backspace icon recolor: Icon_Backspace 2:118 — recolor strokes+fills ink2.\n\nAlso record ids + return.\n\nThen S7 (Sheet/Success + 05) and S8 (reactions) next round.\n\nWrite S5b+S6 script now.","signature":"14fe0efbdf864a008774aad4"}],"id":"73a0fcd7-5d78-4bb2-8136-84d310e67cc5","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b54d81e-1062-44f7-87fa-749cc21f1674","uuid":"a1b25fce-67c5-408d-9a8b-c8b3b5d85838","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:02:12.752Z","thinking_duration_ms":43484}
