`9:296` (y=476..710 step 26), `9:303` pager (label \"Discovery\", dot3 brand), `9:309` home.\n   - 03/04/05 backgrounds: clones of 9:137 + `scrim` rect 375×812 black 45% on top; 03 also has `sheet` instance of Sheet/Strategy at y=812-801=11; 04 has `sheet` instance of Sheet/Amount at y=812-580=232.\n   - `10:363` Sheet/Strategy (component, x=-560, h=801 after grabWrap insert; vertical AL width 375, pad 16/16/10/24, gap 10, topRadius 24, white, drop shadow (0,-8,40,0.18)): grabWrap>grabber 36×4; Header/Sheet inst 'Aggressive Growth'; riskChip (5:4 inst \"🔥 High Risk\", bg #FCE9EA, text #E5484D); two fact rows (3+2 Chip/Fact instances: \"🌱 159% per Year/Interest Income\", \"🔥 High Risk/Level of risk\", \"💵 $1,000/Minimum investment amount\", \"🗓️ 2 Years/Recommended investment period\", \"🧑 1,982/Participants\"); projection card #F5F6FA r16 (\"$1,590.00\" 20 ExtraBold, caption \"This is how much you can earn in a year if you invest $1,000 to “Aggressive Growth”\" 11 Medium ink2, chart 319×64 with vector area (gradient #149E53 35%→0) + line (stroke #149E53 2), labels \"Dec ’21 Mar Jun Sep Dec\" SPACE_BETWEEN 9 ink3); about (\"About Strategy\" 15 Bold + description 12 Regular ink2); share (\"Share of Assets\" 15 Bold + bar 343×8 r4 segments [168,84,42,21,20] colors ['#2B2D33','#565B63','#878D97','#B9BEC7','#E2E5EB'] + 5 Row/Share instances gap 4); Invest button (3:19 inst resized 343×52, name 'invest').\n   - `11:813` Sheet/Amount (component, x=-560 y=850, h=580; same frame style, gap 12): grabWrap>grabber; Header/Sheet 'Invest to Strategy'; currency row (Coin_DAI inst 40, \"DAI\" 15 Bold, spacer, swapChip 32×32 r16 #F5F6FA + Icon_Swap 16 ink2); \"3,021\" 42 ExtraBold; \"⛽️ No gas, free investments\" 11 ink3; balanceRow (Max chip 5:4 inst + spacer + \"Balance 3,045.86 DAI · Minimum $1,000 met\" 10 Medium ink3 right); keypad 4 rows gap 8 of Key/Keypad instances (105×54, gap 8): 1/2 ABC/3 DEF, 4 GHI/5 JKL/6 MNO, 7 PQRS/8 TUV/9 WXYZ, \",\" / 0 / keyBack (custom 105×54 r12 #F5F6FA + Icon_Backspace brand-colored); Btn/Hold inst 343×52 name 'hold'.\n   - Helper code pattern (reuse in every script):\n     ```js\n     const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"4:2\");\n     await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\n     for (const s of [\"Regular\",\"Medium\",\"SemiBold\",\"Bold\",\"ExtraBold\"]) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Nunito\",style:s});\n     const solid=(hex,o=1)=>{const h=hex.replace('#','');return{type:'SOLID',color:{r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255},opacity:o};};\n     async function inst(parent,cid,x,y,name){const m=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(cid);const i=m.createInstance();i.x=x;i.y=y;if(name)i.name=name;parent.appendChild(i);return i;}\n     async function txt(parent,chars,size,style,hex,name){const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'Nunito',style};t.characters=chars;t.fontSize=size;t.fills=[solid(hex)];t.name=name||'t';parent.appendChild(t);return t;}\n     function recolorAll(node,hex){for(const n of node.findAll(nn=>'fills' in nn)){try{n.fills=[solid(hex)];}catch(e){}}for(const n of node.findAll(nn=>'strokes' in nn)){try{if(n.strokes&&n.strokes.length)n.strokes=[solid(hex)];}catch(e){}}}\n     ```\n   - Design tokens: brand #2B2D33; app bg #F2F3F7; card #FFFFFF; ink2 #70767F; ink3 #9AA1AB; line #E6E8EE; chip #EEF0F5; gain #149E53; gainBg #E2F5EA; loss #E5484D; lossBg #FCE9EA; pager inactive dot #C7CBD4; key/field bg #F5F6FA. Type: balance 32 ExtraBold, amount 42 ExtraBold, sheet titles 15-16 Bold, section titles 15 Bold, card titles 12-13 SemiBold, keypad digit 17/letters 9.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - console.log not surfaced (\"Code executed with no return value\") → FIXED: discovered return values DO surface; end every script with `return JSON.stringify({...})`.\n   - Header/Search stuck at 100×100 in first S2 attempt (script aborted mid-construction; cause never fully identified, likely a throw during instance resize/override) → FIXED by r